// SaysList :
"P3131776890" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white>Alright, security is disabled, you two can proceed."
// SaysList :
"P2763441531" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white> Is it me or is this too easy?"
// SaysList :
"P2033818111" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, where did Crow head off to?<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white> Crow, report."
// SaysList :
"P209643123" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white> Wait a minute... something isn't...<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white>No! Get your hands off me!<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor white> {HeroName}! It's...*static*!<t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>Security breach detected.</b></b><t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>WARNING!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=1 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>INTRUDER ALERT!</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>Security breach detected.</b><t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor white><b>All T.E.S.T. Rangers begin security sweeps now.</b><t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>This is Colonel Duray.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>Surprised to hear my voice, {HeroName}?<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>You shouldn't be. I told you...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>Death isn't the end for me.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Red><bgcolor Black>Your dear friends, however... well, I'd hurry if I were you."

