// IntroString :
"P3986120845" "We have no choice, {HeroName}, we've got to get Crow and Helix back before they give up everything. <color orange>Either get them back, or make sure they can't tell them anything.</color><br><br>They're being held inside Lambda Sector, not the easiest place to get into... however, if there are two people that can get in and out of anywhere, it's <color yellow>Tunnel Rat</color> and <color yellow>Splice</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P2055103029" "Break into Lambda Sector"
// SendOffString :
"P3197402341" "Tunnel Rat will lead you to the subterranean perimeter of Lambda Sector. From there, Splice will teleport you into the facility.<br><br>Tunnel Rat can find them, Splice can deactivate any security measures in place, and, well, I'm pretty sure you know what your role is on this rescue mission.<br><br><color orange>Just remember, if you can't escape with them, leave no one alive to talk... even yourself.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P932112118" "Rescue Comrades in Lambda Sector"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2784791608" "Keep Tunnel Rat and Splice Safe."
