// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1488949334" "You rescued Helix and discovered that Crow was a traitor!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1578954418" "Crow was a traitor!?<br><br>That changes everything. He's been with us for months! He... He knew way too much!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2219653165" "We've got dozens of men moving topside for an attack on Neuron's Reach, and the PPD are on their way here right now...<br><br>{HeroName}, we have no choice but to meet them head on in the tunnels. The Ghou... <i>Cupcakes</i> may be green troops, but they know these tunnels better than anyone.<br><br>As far as the PPD is aware, they are on the offensive. Well we're going to change that."
// AcceptString :
"P1112546927" "Attack the PPD in Tunnels"
// SendOffString :
"P857647543" "There's only two approaches they could be taking to get here. Crow knew that this route through <color yellow>Junction 221</color> was the best path in, so that's likely where their force is coming through. We'll devote our main body of troops there and small rear guard here at <color yellow>Junction 117</color>.<br><br>If we can hold the PPD in Junction 221 for long enough, our reinforcements can arrive and we can completely cut them off.<br><br><color orange>{HeroName}, I need you on the front line with our Heavy Barrels.</color> In such tight confines their armor piercing shells will cut the PPD down by the dozens.<br><br>You've got to hold that line."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P169269225" "Hold the Line"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2878298493" "You need to hold the line until reinforcements arrive."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4263111583" "<color deepskyblue>Part 4: The Battle at Junction 221</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P304896047" "Junction 221 is a tangle of side passages and causeways, but they all link up this one single approach."

