// SaysList :
"P1570630850" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black> {HeroName}, this is Scott. We've got contact all over the grid. Hold your position."
// SaysList :
"P402010773" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black> It looks like they've run out of Clockwork... Prepare for the main assault."
// SaysList :
"P994491983" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black>Send in the Cupcakes, disrupt their advance to buy us time."
// SaysList :
"P390686011" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black>Tunnel A9 respond... <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black>Holding force, this is CS, we have a perimeter breach at tunnel A-9."
// SaysList :
"P3936024541" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black>A-9 is contained. I repeat, A-9 is contained."
// SaysList :
"P140194905" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor black>Reinforcements are arriving. Commend mop up."

