// Dialog :
"P1951775550" "We turned back the Loyalists, for now. We're starting plans for an evacuation, but there's something I need you to do."
// RandomFameString :
"P3745043257" "I heard the PPD have the Resistance on the run down in the tunnels."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3350871795" "Crow.<br><br>He's got too much sensitive information and there is no telling how much of it the Loyalists know about. This is why we operate in independent cells, I just... I just didn't think it would be Crow... Damn.<br><br>While I'm warning our allies of any compromises in security that might be exposed by this betrayal, <color orange>I need you to hunt Crow down.</color> We've got a few leads on where he could be, but I have reason to believe that he is at <color orange>Neuron Technologies Unlimited.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1271510037" "Hunt down Crow"
// SendOffString :
"P1340113148" "Do you remember <color yellow>Blood Widow Dahlia</color>? Well, I secured her on loan from Arachnos. She's agreed to help us with our problem and I want you to work with her.<br><br>{HeroName}, be careful, Crow was a capable fighter, that much is obvious, but if he managed to hide his true motives from <color yellow>DeVore</color> and a half dozen other psychics, then there is no telling what he is truly capable of."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3390866416" "Dahlia said that Arachnos agents last spotted Crow in the vicinity Doctor Demetrios Vasilikos' old lab. Start your search there."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3004670887" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Blood Red Vengeance</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4036615912" "You and Dahlia sneak into the facility."

